---
import T from './T.astro';

// Real customer reviews supplied by the owner.
//
// Each review carries both languages. `en` is the original wording for the
// English reviews; `zh` is the original for Jennifer, who wrote in Chinese.
// The other side of each pair is a translation, so the section reads properly
// whichever language the visitor has selected.
//
// To add a review: copy a block and fill in both `en` and `zh`.
const reviews = [
  {
    en: "I can't recommend this homemade sourdough bread enough! It's absolutely delicious, with the perfect crust and soft, flavourful interior. Knowing it's made with quality ingredients and a traditional sourdough process makes it feel like a healthier choice too. The biggest surprise? My daughter is usually very picky about bread, but after trying this, she refuses to eat any other bread and will only eat her homemade sourdough now. That's the highest compliment I can give! If you're looking for fresh, wholesome, and truly amazing sourdough, this is it. Highly recommend!",
    zh: '我真的非常推薦這款手工酸種麵包！非常美味，外皮恰到好處，內裡柔軟又有風味。知道它是用優質食材、以傳統酸種工法製作，讓人覺得更健康。最讓我驚喜的是：我女兒平常對麵包非常挑剔，但吃過這款之後，她再也不肯吃別的麵包，只吃這款手工酸種麵包。這是我能給的最高評價！如果您在找新鮮、健康又真正美味的酸種麵包，就是它了。強烈推薦！',
    name: 'Xing',
  },
  {
    en: 'The very best! I think she adds a lot of love. ❤',
    zh: '真的是最棒的！我想她一定加了滿滿的愛。❤',
    name: 'D. Harvey',
  },
  {
    en: 'I absolutely love this sourdough bread. It has the perfect balance of crisp golden crust and soft interior with the right amount of chew. You can really tell it’s made with care and quality ingredients. It is truly authentic, artisan sourdough.',
    zh: '我非常喜愛這款酸種麵包。金黃酥脆的外皮與柔軟的內裡達到完美平衡，嚼勁恰到好處。一吃就能感受到製作的用心與食材的品質。這是真正道地的手工酸種麵包。',
    name: 'Shelley Roch',
  },
  {
    en: 'Mercy, your sourdough is very addictive. The texture and taste is second to none. We have been ordering your Sourdough Boules for several months now and have never been disappointed. With every bite, we get confirmation of the quality of ingredients you use and the care you take in baking the boules. You not only have us hooked, but also our daughter and son in law. Thank you so much.',
    zh: 'Mercy，妳的酸種麵包實在讓人上癮。口感與風味無人能及。我們訂購妳的酸種圓麵包已經好幾個月了，從來沒有失望過。每一口都讓我們再次確認妳所選用的食材品質，以及烘焙時的用心。不只我們著迷，連我們的女兒和女婿也一樣。真的非常感謝。',
    name: 'Ayaz',
  },
  {
    en: 'A truly delectable bake — Mercy Mills Sourdough products are mouth watering good! Everything from the golden brown crust, the perfect shape, and the amazing texture, aroma and flavour make these sourdough batch products a regular purchase for my home. Five star yummy!',
    zh: '真正美味的烘焙——Mercy Mill Sourdough 的產品好吃到讓人垂涎！從金黃的外皮、完美的形狀，到絕佳的口感、香氣與風味，都讓這些酸種產品成為我家的常備採購。五星級的美味！',
    name: 'Susan Kuyer',
  },
  {
    en: 'This sourdough loaf was seriously delicious! The crust was perfectly crisp, while the inside was soft, chewy, and full of that classic tangy sourdough flavor. It tasted super fresh and had the perfect texture — definitely a loaf I’d happily buy again!',
    zh: '這條酸種麵包真的太好吃了！外皮酥脆得恰到好處，內裡柔軟有嚼勁，充滿經典的酸種微酸風味。吃起來非常新鮮，口感完美——我一定會再回購！',
    name: 'Nafeesa Brown',
  },
  {
    en: "I can't say enough about Mercy's sourdough. Her dedication and the research she's put into perfecting her recipes shines through every flavourful, crunchy, chewy bite. She is unwilling to accept anything but perfection in her recipes, which is what makes her sourdough breads and stuffed bagels the ultimate favorites in our household. I would guess the English Muffins are too, but I wouldn't know since my kid ate them before I even got a chance. Next time I'm hiding them!",
    zh: '對於 Mercy 的酸種麵包，我再怎麼稱讚都不夠。她對完善食譜的投入與鑽研，在每一口香濃、酥脆又有嚼勁的麵包中展露無遺。她對自己的配方絕不將就，這正是為什麼她的酸種麵包和夾餡貝果成為我們家的最愛。我猜英式馬芬應該也是，但我無從得知——還沒輪到我，就被我家小孩吃光了。下次我要把它們藏起來！',
    name: 'Adelle',
  },
  {
    // Jennifer wrote in Chinese; the English here is a translation.
    en: 'The moment I got home today I couldn’t wait — I cut the loaf open straight away and ate two slices. It’s so good: incredibly soft inside, wonderfully chewy, and packed with fillings. The cranberries aren’t sour at all, which I love, and there are so many walnuts. If I had an oven to crisp the crust up it would be a perfect score! My stomach felt completely settled afterwards. Thank you for such delicious bread. I left a quarter out and put the rest in the freezer for next time — I hope to try the other flavours soon!',
    zh: '我今天已經迫不及待一買回來趕快先把麵包切開來試吃了兩片，麵包很好吃，裡面非常軟，非常Q，而且滿滿的材料，蔓越莓一點不會酸我很喜歡，核桃也好多，要是我有烤箱把皮烤得脆脆的，就會一百分了！我吃完腸胃覺得很舒服，謝謝你這麼好吃的麵包。我留了 ¼ 在外面，其他的我放進冷凍庫裡下次要吃再拿出來，希望下次可以試一下其他的口味！',
    name: 'Jennifer',
  },
];
---

<section id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="reviews-head">
      <span class="eyebrow"><T en="Kind words" zh="顧客好評" /></span>
      <h2><T en="What our customers say" zh="顧客怎麼說" /></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="reviews-masonry">
      {reviews.map((r) => (
        <figure class="review">
          <div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <blockquote><T en={r.en} zh={r.zh} /></blockquote>
          <figcaption>— {r.name}</figcaption>
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .reviews-head { max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }

  /* Multi-column masonry handles the very different quote lengths gracefully */
  .reviews-masonry {
    columns: 3;
    column-gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .review {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    background: var(--white);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 1.6rem 1.7rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border: 1px solid rgba(58, 42, 30, 0.06);
    display: inline-block;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .stars { color: var(--amber); letter-spacing: 0.15em; margin-bottom: 0.7rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .review blockquote {
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--crust-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  /* Chinese needs a little more breathing room between lines */
  :global(html[data-lang='zh']) .review blockquote { line-height: 1.9; }
  .review figcaption { font-weight: 600; color: var(--crust); font-size: 0.95rem; }

  @media (max-width: 980px) { .reviews-masonry { columns: 2; } }
  @media (max-width: 620px) { .reviews-masonry { columns: 1; } }
</style>
